@startuml cu20
!theme plain
title CU20 — Eliminar estado de gestión

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to delete a management status.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Shows a list of every available status.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects a status and confirms the deletion.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Deletes the selected status.
System -> System : System

@enduml